# Day 28 – Microsoft Graph Explorer: Query Users and Groups

## Objective

Use Microsoft Graph Explorer to authenticate to a Microsoft Entra ID tenant and retrieve identity information through Microsoft Graph API requests.

This lab demonstrates how IAM administrators can query users and groups without relying only on the Microsoft Entra admin center.

---

## Scenario

The IAM team needs a directory report containing:

- The signed-in administrator account
- All users in the tenant
- All groups in the tenant
- A specific user
- Selected user attributes

Microsoft Graph Explorer was used to retrieve this information through REST API requests.

---

## Lab Environment

- Microsoft Entra ID Free
- Microsoft Entra Admin Center
- Microsoft Graph Explorer
- Microsoft Authenticator
- Microsoft Graph API
- JSON
- OAuth 2.0 access tokens

